{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tasks/a-muted-agent-s-answer-in-a-delegated-room-is-kept-once",
  "title": "A muted agent shared into a delegated room no transport is shared into answers the task at once: the trace keeps its answer once, beside the delegated agent's",
  "rules": [
    "§23.3 step 3",
    "§23.3 step 5",
    "§7.5"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/tasks/test_child_room_trace.py::test_a_muted_worker_answer_is_committed_once; core/mixins/delegation.py _open_child_room (a shared binding keeps its muted), core/event_router.py (a muted channel's buffered answer re-enters, never stored by the router itself), core/mixins/_child_execution.py _collect_answer (_buffered_outcome commits each buffered answer once). The Python test mutes the delegated agent itself through the private _broadcast_and_collect; the public form mutes an agent shared into the room. The timeline holds BLOCKED records: the observer's answer is one row, whatever its status.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "worker",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "Do the task."
            },
            "respond": [
              {
                "content": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "body": "W1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "observer",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "Do the task."
            },
            "respond": [
              {
                "content": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "body": "O1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "observer",
            "category": "intelligence",
            "muted": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "task": "Do the task.",
      "share_channels": [
        "observer"
      ],
      "wait": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "completed",
          "result": {
            "output": "W1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "bindings": {
      "$r1": {
        "observer": {
          "muted": true
        }
      }
    },
    "timeline": {
      "$r1": {
        "$unordered": [
          {
            "index": 0,
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "system"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Do the task."
            }
          },
          {
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "worker"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "W1"
            }
          },
          {
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "observer"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "O1"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
